1
00:00:02,135 --> 00:00:03,865
Previously on The Big Bang Theory:

2
00:00:04,037 --> 00:00:07,667
We now pronounce you
husband and wife.

3
00:00:10,143 --> 00:00:13,603
- I love this part!
- Me too!

4
00:00:13,780 --> 00:00:16,980
I have strongly mixed feelings.

5
00:00:19,085 --> 00:00:22,245
So Howard's really in space?

6
00:00:22,422 --> 00:00:25,912
(Scene:)The International Space Station,
250 miles that way. Heh.

7
00:00:26,092 --> 00:00:28,892
(Raj:)Right now Howard
is staring down at our planet...

8
00:00:29,062 --> 00:00:31,552
(Raj:)...like a tiny Jewish Greek god.

9
00:00:32,966 --> 00:00:35,266
(Raj:)Zeus-owitz.

10
00:00:35,735 --> 00:00:39,105
(Sheldon:)I must admit,
I can't help but feel a twinge of envy.

11
00:00:39,272 --> 00:00:41,102
(Sheldon:)He can look out the window...

12
00:00:41,274 --> 00:00:45,044
(Sheldon:)...and see the majesty of the universe
unfolding before his eyes.

13
00:00:45,211 --> 00:00:48,441
(Sheldon:)His dim, uncomprehending eyes.

14
00:00:51,284 --> 00:00:54,654
(Sheldon:)It's like a cat in an airport carrying case.

15
00:00:56,423 --> 00:00:58,623
(Leonard:)You know,
it's not exactly glamorous up there.

16
00:00:58,792 --> 00:01:03,022
The water the astronauts drink
is made from each other's recycled urine.

